.com/users/santoshkumarradha","html_url":"https://github.com/santoshkumarradha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/santoshkumarradha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T23:57:56Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T23:57:56Z","body":"**Classification:** `bug`, `area:chat`, `sev:serious` → milestone **Reliable agent**.\n\n- `area:chat` — all three read paths are tui3 (`place_spend.go`, `settingspend.go`, `treespend.go`); the fix is reading one settled accounting view.\n- `sev:serious` — three money figures that disagree after an ordinary interrupt.\n- **Reliable agent** — \"spend that match reality\" is literally that milestone's bar, even though the disagreeing surfaces are chat.\n\n<sub>drafted with [CodeAF](https://agentfield.ai/github/codeaf?utm_source=github&utm_medium=comment&utm_campaign=drafted_with)</sub>\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Agent-Field/CodeAF/issues/comments/5769271059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"santoshkumarradha","id":29346072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ2MDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29346072?v=4","gravat